      "id": "scratch_nestjs_dx_parity_research_performance_withroutememory_bottleneck",
      "label": "E1: Unconditional withRouteMemory Transform Hook",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Injecting a transform hook onto every decorated route disqualifies Elysia inlineBareRoute and writes to a WeakMap per request even when no observer package reads matchedRouteOf.",
