      "label": "C1: TypeBox Compile(schema).Parse vs Interpreted Value.Parse",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Replacing interpreted typebox/value Convert+Parse+structuredClone (623k ops/s) with typebox/compile Compile(schema).Parse (40.07M ops/s) yields a 64.3x speedup.",
